  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 174706252990243685
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Every Saturday morning.
    - rid: 471661797109108123
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I am not asking for one.
    - rid: 764703551303860565
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Think of it as an open invitation waiting for the house.
    - rid: 1216375881208897736
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: She paid in coins and opinions.
    - rid: 1266703261948156259
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I chair the neighborhood association now.
    - rid: 3671143702790653365
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: When the property is ready.
    - rid: 5239548633418834494
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I was told there was excellent coffee and visible progress.
    - rid: 5744193451335511477
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Mostly opinions.
    - rid: 6394258329972744506
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: What brings you here?
    - rid: 6462075169002953818
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I may have used those exact words.
    - rid: 7025705464420908511
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: We have not held our summer garden evening since Evelyn stopped hosting
          it.
    - rid: 7228583998400770790
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Arthur Cole? Grandma used to buy bread from your bakery.
    - rid: 8548600076149729631
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: You want to hold it here again?
    - rid: 9001056290209830880
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I cannot promise a date.
